<span id="Ax1.T5.5.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="Ax1.T5.5.5.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">PegInsertionside</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="Ax1.T5.5.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb" style="padding:2.3pt 5.0pt;">
<span id="Ax1.T5.5.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax1.T5.5.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax1.T5.5.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">The task is considered successful if the tail end of the peg lies within the coordinate frame of the box hole, with an offset along the insertion direction no greater than 2 cm, and offsets along the other two orthogonal directions both smaller than 8 mm.</span></span>
</span></td>
